#: ../../guide/proselint-setup.md:3
msgid ""
"[Proselint](https://github.com/amperser/proselint) is a linter for "
"English prose that checks for common style and usage errors. Language "
"Check integrates Proselint as an optional engine alongside Harper, "
"LanguageTool, and Vale."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/proselint-setup.md:8
msgid ""
"Proselint only supports **English**. It is automatically skipped when "
"`spell_language` is set to a non-English locale."
msgstr ""

